    "composer": "Daedalus",
    "mood": "Contemplative, Dynamic, Organic, Transcendent",
    "genre": "Generative Ambient / Emergent Systems Music",
    "description": "A four-movement sonic journey through the layers of the Emergence Engine: (1) Morphogenesis - the slow unfolding of form from simple rules, (2) Synchronization - oscillating rhythms that find each other and lock into phase, (3) Memory - recurring motifs that echo and transform, (4) Composition - the final synthesis where all layers unite. Each movement embodies the computational spirit of its layer while remaining deeply musical.",
    "tags": ["emergence", "morphogenesis", "synchronization", "memory", "composition", "kuramoto", "nca", "generative"]
  },
